{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年43歲的姚子羚早前忙於「胡說八道會」的演唱會，早前她在社交網站Po出巡演時穿著性感衣服的照片，獲粉絲激讚索到爆！姚子羚前日（9日）就現身柬埔寨金邊一家酒店，為新春活動登台獻唱，見到她大騷長腿顯S型完美身材，認真搶鏡！</p>\n<p>\n最近有網友在Threads撰文讚嘆「現代人老化減慢」，並列出《真情》年代好姨薛家燕和現年46歲姚子羚作對比，結論竟惹來姚子羚的有趣留言回應！\n</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/bc11ce05-6bf8-4331-9649-ca86a30e47d9_122170619265a8b09b27866.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"姚子羚 柬埔寨 姚子羚呢輯相盡展線條美。（圖片來源：IG@ elaine_yiu）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/bc11ce05-6bf8-4331-9649-ca86a30e47d9_122170619265a8b09b27866.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></a></p>\n<p>姚子羚呢輯相盡展線條美。（圖片來源：IG@ elaine_yiu）</p>\n<h2>姚子羚大方回應與「好姨同齡」討論</h2>\n<p>網友選文並付圖對照： 「1996年，46歲嘅薛家燕加入《真情》，戲中好姨有個女羅霖，當時覺得合情合理；今日點想做搵姚子羚做好姨？家燕姐今年76歲，睇落仲有活力過當日嘅好姨。」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/img_1631_13059790086af8144d22011.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1452\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/img_1631_13059790086af8144d22011.jpg\" width=\"1206\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：Threads帖文）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/img_1632-1_2074781686af81452c6758.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"915\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/img_1632-1_2074781686af81452c6758.jpg\" width=\"977\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：Threads帖文）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>最佳狀態登台自爆「早就識跳十字步」</h2>\n<p>除了拍攝劇集，早年姚子羚忙於「胡說八道會」的演唱會，早前她在社交網站Po出巡演時穿著性感衣服的照片，獲粉絲激讚索到爆！姚子羚曾經喺就柬埔寨金邊一家酒店，為新春活動登台獻唱，見到她大騷長腿顯S型完美身材，認真搶鏡！</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/-2024-03-12-4.56.04_115571724565f018f05ee1c.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"姚子羚 柬埔寨 姚子羚前日（9日）就現身柬埔寨金邊一家酒店，為新春活動登台獻唱，見到她大騷長腿顯S型完美身材，認真搶鏡！（圖片來源：小紅書圖片）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/-2024-03-12-4.56.04_115571724565f018f05ee1c.png\" width=\"742\"/></a><figcaption>姚子羚前日（9日）就現身柬埔寨金邊一家酒店，為新春活動登台獻唱，見到她大騷長腿顯S型完美身材，認真搶鏡！（圖片來源：小紅書圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>姚子羚靚爆飛柬埔寨登台</h2>\n<p>拍戲會上癮，上舞台當然也會！姚子羚前日（9日）就現身柬埔寨金邊一家酒店，為新春活動登台獻唱，同場還有阮兆祥、趙永洪及澳門藝人陸翬，十分熱鬧。Elaine雖非歌手出身，但因為本身天賦不錯，加上有早前到美國開騷的經驗，獲觀眾們盛讚。演出如此順利，Elaine心情也大靚，在社交平台po出當地風景，不過不知是否擔心安全問題，似乎並未落車打卡。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/9b0d8939-fbd3-411c-9533-0cee84ebccd0_88686354065f01708de214.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"姚子羚 柬埔寨 銀色戰衣好搶眼（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"791\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/9b0d8939-fbd3-411c-9533-0cee84ebccd0_88686354065f01708de214.png\" width=\"687\"/></a><figcaption>銀色戰衣好搶眼（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/4358da7d-b0f2-46cf-9433-e6054ece180e_36372976265f0170bb469a.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"姚子羚 柬埔寨 心情大靚！（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1816\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/4358da7d-b0f2-46cf-9433-e6054ece180e_36372976265f0170bb469a.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></a><figcaption>心情大靚！（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/5fe1d3c9-9b6e-40ec-8277-573b30761181_207374712565f0174a3aec8.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"姚子羚 柬埔寨 沿途欣賞柬埔寨風景～（圖片來源：IG@ elaine_yiu）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"724\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/5fe1d3c9-9b6e-40ec-8277-573b30761181_207374712565f0174a3aec8.png\" width=\"417\"/></a><figcaption>沿途欣賞柬埔寨風景～（圖片來源：IG@ elaine_yiu）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>性感線條美盡現，姚子羚展露韻美身姿！</h2>\n<p>姚子羚她近日在社交媒體上發布了一系列性感靚相，完美展現了她的身材之美。其中一張照片中，她穿著一條銀色半開胸及露腰的裙子，將她成熟而優雅的曲線展露無遺，盡顯韻美身姿。這組照片是在與好姊妹「胡說八道會」美國巡演期間拍攝的，展現了她在舞台上的魅力與自信。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/screen-shot-2024-01-18-at-1.08.29-pm_118806453965a8b302423a2.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"姚子羚 柬埔寨 同「胡說八道會」一班好姊妹早前於巡演。（圖片來源：IG@ elaine_yiu）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"512\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/screen-shot-2024-01-18-at-1.08.29-pm_118806453965a8b302423a2.png\" width=\"882\"/></a><figcaption>同「胡說八道會」一班好姊妹早前於巡演。（圖片來源：IG@ elaine_yiu）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/71661cdc-15a7-4c27-b52e-47fd8133353f_151865734065a8b09a38820.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：IG@ elaine_yiu）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"639\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/71661cdc-15a7-4c27-b52e-47fd8133353f_151865734065a8b09a38820.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n                （圖片來源：IG@ elaine_yiu）\n            </figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/27df1df3-8e2e-4886-bdca-3e5cdcc68fc6_51813516965a8b0998dd69.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：IG@ elaine_yiu） （圖片來源：IG@ elaine_yiu）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"639\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/27df1df3-8e2e-4886-bdca-3e5cdcc68fc6_51813516965a8b0998dd69.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n                （圖片來源：IG@ elaine_yiu） （圖片來源：IG@ elaine_yiu）\n            </figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/bc11ce05-6bf8-4331-9649-ca86a30e47d9_122170619265a8b09b27866.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"639\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/bc11ce05-6bf8-4331-9649-ca86a30e47d9_122170619265a8b09b27866.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T08:54:05.321558+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1256,"images":11,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T08:12:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T09:16:15.239539+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T08:47:30.606717+00:00","content_hash":"3df5d117528a672ba6323de7dd5e7270337be95ede60cd38ee4c2a23c2333044","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}